:R-HSA-9818749  a           owl:NamedIndividual , obo:GO_0008150 ;
        rdfs:comment        "Sub-pathway represents a collection of events involved in the expression of the NFE2L2 gene. The NFE2L2 gene is transcriptionally regulated by multiple transcription factors like Myc, NFKB, NFE2L2 itself and many more. This diverse regulation of NFE2L2 connects its regulation with other signalling pathways (He et al, 2020)" ;
        rdfs:label          "Regulation of NFE2L2 gene expression" ;
        dc:contributor      "Authored: Tiwari, Krishna, 2022-10-10" , "Edited: Tiwari, Krishna, 2022-10-10" , "GOC:reactome_curators" ;
